<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-breadcrumbs">
    <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a>
    <span>/</span>
    <span>Frequently Asked Questions</span>
  </div>
  <h1 class="page-title">{{ section.settings.title | default: 'FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS &amp; 21+ GUIDE' }}</h1>
  <p class="page-subtitle">
    {{ section.settings.subtitle | default: 'Everything you need to know about our shelf stability, small-batch ingredients, 21+ adult ID courier delivery laws, and master serving rituals.' }}
  </p>
</section>

<main class="faq-page-container">
  <div class="faq-search-box">
    <input type="text" id="faq-search-input" placeholder="Search keywords: shelf life, 21+, allergens, signature, courier..." aria-label="Search FAQs">
  </div>

  <div class="faq-category-block">
    <h2 class="faq-category-title">SHELF LIFE &amp; STORAGE</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      
      <details class="pdp-accordion faq-item" open>
        <summary class="accordion-header">
          <span>How long do Lucky Shaker cocktails stay fresh?</span>
          <span class="accordion-arrow">&plus;</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          <p>Unopened bottles have an ambient shelf stability of <strong>12 months</strong> from the distillation date printed on each neck seal. Once opened, store in the refrigerator (below 4°C / 40°F) and enjoy within <strong>6 months</strong> for peak botanical aroma and mouthfeel.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="pdp-accordion faq-item">
        <summary class="accordion-header">
          <span>Why does Whiskey Cream contain real dairy cream?</span>
          <span class="accordion-arrow">&plus;</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          <p>We refuse to use synthetic palm oil or non-dairy powders. We use 100% pasteurized farm dairy cream. Natural separation can occasionally occur at cold temperatures—simply give the bottle 3 vigorous shakes before pouring over ice.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-category-block">
    <h2 class="faq-category-title">SHIPPING &amp; 21+ ADULT SIGNATURE</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">

      <details class="pdp-accordion faq-item" open>
        <summary class="accordion-header">
          <span>Why is a 21+ adult signature strictly required at delivery?</span>
          <span class="accordion-arrow">&plus;</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          <p>Under United States federal law (27 CFR § 251) and individual state alcohol control boards, couriers (FedEx/UPS/specialized liquor couriers) are legally prohibited from releasing parcels containing distilled spirits without inspecting a valid government photo ID proving the recipient is at least 21 years of age. Packages cannot be left unattended on porches.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="pdp-accordion faq-item">
        <summary class="accordion-header">
          <span>What happens if my bottle breaks during shipping?</span>
          <span class="accordion-arrow">&plus;</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          <p>Every bottle is shipped in custom-molded shock-absorbent thermal air cushions. In the rare event of transit damage, take a quick photo and email <strong>concierge@luckyshaker.com</strong> within 48 hours. We will immediately dispatch a priority replacement bottle at 100% zero cost to you.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<script>
document.getElementById('faq-search-input')?.addEventListener('input', function(e) {
  var term = e.target.value.toLowerCase().trim();
  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item').forEach(function(item) {
    var txt = item.textContent.toLowerCase();
    item.style.display = txt.includes(term) ? 'block' : 'none';
  });
});
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ Page",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Hero Title",
      "default": "FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS & 21+ GUIDE"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "subtitle",
      "label": "Hero Subtitle",
      "default": "Everything you need to know about our shelf stability, small-batch ingredients, 21+ adult ID courier delivery laws, and master serving rituals."
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
